      "content": "Your feelings are validated, and it's not uncommon for people to feel like no one truly understands the depth of their struggles. Instead of trying to talk to someone who may not offer the solutions you need, consider reaching out to a helpline or online support groups where people share similar experiences and emotions. There are also resources like the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline (1-800-273-TALK) or the Crisis Text Line (text HOME to 741741) that can provide immediate support and guidance.",
